WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:15.451
Support Admin Watch on
kissasia.cam or kisskh.org

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:25.100
Zhuang.

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.950
Thank you.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:32.290
Please sign it here.

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.090
Zhongwen.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:55.630
You're leaving?

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.390
[OOPS! I'M IN JAIL]

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:42.170
[Episode 4]

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.329
Since when did our prison turn
into a restaurant?

00:02:44.329 --> 00:02:44.750
I had no clue!

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:45.829
[Custody Division]

00:02:45.829 --> 00:02:47.460
This is awesome.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.410
He's even getting special treatment
from the administrators.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:53.470
If I didn't know better, I'd think
he was an officer on an inspection tour.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.390
He thinks he's here on a campaign.

00:02:55.390 --> 00:02:57.250
-Morning, Assistant Chen.
-Morning.

00:02:57.250 --> 00:02:59.500
He's even strolling around
with his hands in his pockets...

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:00.830
What are you staring at?

00:03:03.070 --> 00:03:04.070
Get a move on!

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.550
Hi, Assistant Chen. You're here.

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:09.110
Chief will be here shortly.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:11.320
Take Assistant Chen
to the meeting room. Right now.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:12.070
Yes.

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:13.350
I'll just wait inside.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.210
Alright.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:16.090
Look at that smug look on his face.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:16.840
Exactly!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.610
Why don't you have a seat first?

00:03:20.250 --> 00:03:21.380
Please, take a seat.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:23.550
Would you like some tea?

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:24.280
Are you okay?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:26.790
Hey, Zhongwen.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.720
Did the VIP tip you?

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:32.600
His attitude is so damn annoying.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:33.870
He's just an assistant,

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.270
not the councilor himself.

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:37.420
He's putting on that act
like he's some big shot.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:39.910
You mean "a fox borrowing
the tiger's ferocity".

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.370
I only found out later that

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:43.150
he took the fall for his boss.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:44.680
So now he's under the boss's protection.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.500
You'd better not mess with him.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.030
[Chief, Custody Division]

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:47.230
His backer is a real big shot.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:47.980
Shui,

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:50.280
is it okay to leave him here
without Chief?

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.579
Well, Chief is the one
who asked him to come.

00:03:52.579 --> 00:03:53.670
What, do you have too much free time?

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:54.730
Stop standing around

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:55.940
and get back to work!

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:01.850
Zhongwen.

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:04.910
Come in and brew some Pu'er tea for me.

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.110
Zhongwen?

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:11.380
Zhongwen!

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.460
Zhongwen!

00:04:17.970 --> 00:04:19.220
Hurry up, Zhongwen!

00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:24.330
Zhongwen...

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:28.830
Jiajun...

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.200
Get away!

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:32.720
Disgusting.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.550
What's the matter, Assistant Chen?

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:39.670
How did you decide on this topic?

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:42.240
How did you make your selection?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.240
And what was your research process?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:47.090
And what contribution

00:04:47.110 --> 00:04:48.310
does this thesis make

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:49.850
to the academic community?

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:52.270
Actually, initially I intended to...

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:55.200
These are the exact questions
for your oral defense.

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:57.510
Don't worry.

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.260
I'll write down all the answers
and everything for you.

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.190
All you need to do is memorize them.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.120
If you're still unsure,

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:06.140
I can just give
the committee member a call.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:07.920
Why would we
bother the committee member with this?

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:11.270
With your professional help,
it should be more than enough, right?

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.350
Here, Assistant Chen. It's from

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.970
that popular shop with the long lines.
I waited specially for you.

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:15.760
How nice!

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:16.510
Have a piece.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:18.290
Chief,

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:22.960
about my previous application
for the minimum-security transfer...

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.330
Don't you worry, Assistant Chen.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.960
I'll give it another push.

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:27.260
It's absolutely in the bag.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.760
Then you really need
to keep pushing on it.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:30.670
Of course.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:31.590
Here, try some.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.430
Assistant Chen, you...

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:42.170
It's not that. My...

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.360
My teeth have been a bit sensitive.

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:46.760
I've actually had a toothache recently.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:47.740
Toothache?

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.240
Assistant Chen, I know all
about toothaches.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:52.870
When it flares up,
you can't get anything done all day!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:53.870
Hey, you!

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.950
Take Assistant Chen
to the Health Division, now!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:58.010
Tell them to arrange for a dentist today.

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:58.710
Chief,

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.210
I have other duties later, should I...

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:02.460
What duties?

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.710
This takes priority.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.580
Take him now, quickly!

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:06.920
I'll head there now then.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.330
Go, and hurry! No dragging!

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:09.330
No delays. This is urgent!

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:10.970
Okay, we can discuss the rest later.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:12.790
And if anything else comes up,
tell me immediately.

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:13.630
Keep me informed.

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:14.440
Okay.

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.730
-Let's go.
-Make sure he's taken care of.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:32.500
Have you been smoking secretly?

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.040
-Yeah, I have.
-Sneaking smokes, huh?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.500
Okay, smoke less.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.580
What color is that saliva?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.340
White.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.530
White. Okay.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:42.510
White.

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.750
Hello, Miss Xiaohui.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:46.750
I'm younger than you.

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.220
So, what brings you in today?

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:50.250
I brought Inmate 7234
for a dental appointment.

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.750
The doctor isn't in yet.

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:53.280
Why are you here so early?

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.140
On Chief's orders.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.350
Have a seat inside.

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:15.360
Here's the case file. Take a look.

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:15.980
Okay.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:17.240
What's wrong with him now?

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.490
Toothache.

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.900
He's always pulling strings
to get privileges.

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:22.030
It's so irritating.

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:40.220
You scared me!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:42.950
What are you doing?

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:44.960
His uniform was sticking out,

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.370
so I was tucking it back in.

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:47.430
What's the matter?

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:51.610
Can you please get the doctor quickly?

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.280
Zhongwen,

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.680
did he do anything to you just now?

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:57.870
Tell me the truth, did he?

00:07:59.570 --> 00:08:00.250
No.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.210
You have to tell me
what happened so I can help you.

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:05.210
Really, nothing.

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:43.090
Oh my god!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.040
Z-Zhongwen.

00:08:49.260 --> 00:08:49.890
Zhongwen!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.460
Yu Jiajun,

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:52.730
we've got a problem!

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:53.820
Zhongwen!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.400
Over here!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:56.880
Get up, Zhongwen!

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:57.500
Zhongwen!

00:08:57.690 --> 00:08:59.550
Zhongwen, what's wrong with you?

00:09:00.860 --> 00:09:01.860
Why so much blood?

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:07.930
What's wrong with you?

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:08.660
Are you okay?

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:10.310
My nose is bleeding again.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.160
You scared me to death!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:14.210
Hey, Zhongwen!

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:17.330
If you've got something to say,
you have to tell us!

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.120
Do you really have to
scare people like this?

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:22.990
What's going on?
You're really stressed, huh?

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:25.050
Is it because of that Assistant Chen?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.150
Look on the bright side!

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:33.740
This might be your best chance
to get a full-time position.

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:35.370
Everything you do

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:37.260
in your career comes with a price.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.180
Just push through it,
and it'll pay off.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:40.170
Okay?

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.150
Let's switch then. How about that?

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:45.610
Well, I never signed up
to be anyone's slave.

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.240
Just ignore him!

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:49.710
Why did you even
heat up his visitor's food?

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.110
Just take it in directly!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.260
Did he share any with you?

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.780
I wouldn't eat it anyway!

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:58.980
He gropes me every day. It's disgusting!

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:00.590
He gropes you?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:02.830
Then why don't you grope him back, huh?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:04.160
Grope all you want then!

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:17.650
If it's really unbearable,

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:20.140
you should report it to Director Xiao.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.190
Telling Director Xiao won't help.

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.970
Inmate 7234 requested me

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.800
specifically through Chief Hu.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:29.990
Chief Hu?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.180
He's clever, I'll give him that—

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.670
finding a rookie to boss around

00:10:35.670 --> 00:10:36.960
who wouldn't dare squeak.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:39.710
Plus, he's got a chief backing him up.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:42.070
It's not about bossing me around.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:46.760
Inmate 7234 requested me specifically

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.880
because he likes me.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.470
He heard I want a full-time position

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:05.720
and told me to follow him,

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:07.370
said he'd help me.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.740
But after I started,

00:11:11.820 --> 00:11:13.620
he started groping me every day.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.190
If I refuse him,

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:16.910
he threatens

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.330
to have me fired.

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:24.580
Where does he grope you?

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.540
Pretty much everywhere.

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.020
Seriously?

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:58.550
I'm actually reviewing his
open prison application right now.

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.140
So,

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.570
did Inmate 7234 do something
to Zhongwen?

00:12:01.710 --> 00:12:04.130
Through the curtain, it looked like

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:05.960
Inmate 7234 was groping him.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:08.310
But I can't be sure, you know?

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.620
It's just that Zhongwen's reaction

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:10.680
seemed really off.

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.880
But Zhongwen didn't say anything?

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:17.540
Well, I asked him!
He said nothing happened,

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:19.690
but I could tell he was really scared.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:21.490
And Xiaohui told me

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:24.650
Chief Hu has been giving Inmate 7234
special treatment lately—

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:27.540
he even specifically requested Zhongwen
as his custody guard.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.600
Another one abusing his privileges.

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:45.620
[Review Result:
Open Prison Application Denied]

00:12:48.140 --> 00:12:49.990
[Ineligible]

00:12:59.370 --> 00:13:01.370
Denied? Why?

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.290
I'm not sure either, to be honest.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:05.620
I'll find out more.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.470
What exactly is going on now?

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:14.000
Assistant Chen, please don't put me
in a difficult position.

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:16.710
About your application being denied...

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:18.880
is it possible that it's because...

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:23.910
Black Tea: 3 bottles.

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:30.610
Could it possibly be because

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:33.250
your recent conduct has been a bit too...

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.850
Well, you know
how people talk around here.

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.080
Did he do anything to you just now?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:41.130
Tell me the truth, did he?

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:01.560
Reporting, Sir.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.170
Assistant Chen isn't feeling well

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:04.270
and needs to go to the Health Division.

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:05.270
What's going on?

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.040
It's... dizziness.

00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:07.990
Low blood sugar.

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:09.880
Low blood sugar?

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:14.470
Okay.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.050
Is it your kidney that's hurting?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.780
You'll see once you're inside!

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:31.530
Wa, come on. Have a smoke.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:45.220
What's this for?

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:47.110
Health Division is right ahead.

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:49.130
Open the door.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:51.580
I want to go in first to have a smoke.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:01.410
Look, a pet!

00:15:03.620 --> 00:15:04.610
I wanted a cat.

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:07.610
What's this? Cat food?

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:11.100
Cats are really hard to get in here.

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:12.240
Look at this goldfish!

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:13.440
Its eyes are so big.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:14.620
It's watching you.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:17.980
So ugly...

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:19.580
If you have something on your mind,
you can talk to it.

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:20.690
It won't tell anyone.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:21.580
Right?

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:22.860
Tiantian.

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:25.650
He's calling you inside. Hurry up.

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.210
Wa, I'll take that as your accepting it.

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:34.850
Actually, there's something

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.080
I need to ask of you.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:39.510
Could you please talk to Inmate 7234

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:41.500
and tell him to stop harassing my buddy?

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.880
Assistant Chen?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.440
The COs from your batch
are all so handsome!

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.300
Which one is it?

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.150
This is the first time
I'm hearing this story.

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:58.150
How come you never got that benefit?

00:15:58.460 --> 00:15:59.750
I have self-respect.

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:01.370
Wa.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:14.470
Wa,

00:16:15.430 --> 00:16:17.560
could you do this for me? Please.

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.300
Inside here,

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.670
you mind your business,
and I'll mind mine.

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.970
He doesn't cause trouble for me,

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:26.830
and I won't cause trouble for him.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.210
Tell your buddy:

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:29.310
if this isn't for him,

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:30.910
he should just go home early.

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:40.740
Boss!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:56.410
I've been so good to you,

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.020
and you stab me in the back?

00:16:58.050 --> 00:16:59.110
What are you doing?

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:00.940
Inmate 7234.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:04.220
Make another sound,

00:17:04.740 --> 00:17:06.800
and I'll have you fired immediately.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.579
Your wife can forget about her exam too.

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:13.740
Zhuang, go outside and keep watch.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:14.490
Yes.

00:17:17.359 --> 00:17:18.050
Come here.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:24.930
Come here!

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:43.020
Constipated?

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.910
Nah, I'm just thinking about Zhongwen.

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:51.220
Same here.

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:55.540
But what can we do?

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.330
At our level,

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.800
if we file a complaint,
no one will listen.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.750
We just have to wait it out.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.650
It's Inmate 7765.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.130
Inmate 7765!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.550
Why are you here all by yourself?

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:18.870
I just went to the Health Division.

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:20.070
I'm heading back now.

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:22.610
Was that too hard?

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:23.540
Sorry.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.380
Sorry, let me check

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:26.650
if you're hurt.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:27.560
Are you okay?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.050
Are you alright?

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.670
Wait, wasn't Zhongwen

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:39.130
supposed to be guarding
you and Inmate 7234?

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.030
Zhongwen, where are you right now?

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.580
This is Zhiyao to Health Division.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:53.580
Is Inmate 7234 currently
receiving treatment there?

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:54.550
This is Shun;

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:56.460
Inmate 7234 is not
in the Health Division.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:57.460
Freeze!

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:00.770
So where exactly is Inmate 7234?

00:19:00.770 --> 00:19:01.970
I don't know.

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.250
I'm going back.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:05.870
Zhongwen, where are you? Can you hear me?

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:10.520
Zhongwen, are you with Inmate 7234?

00:19:10.550 --> 00:19:12.010
Respond if you can hear me!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:15.040
Take your hands off!

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:16.510
Just for a second.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:17.080
Come on.

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.180
Zhongwen!

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:20.510
Wang Zhongwen, where are you?

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:22.060
Please! Don't!

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.310
Zhongwen, where are you?

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:25.570
Respond now if you can hear me,
Zhongwen!

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:31.260
Help!

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.920
Officer! Help me!

00:19:37.850 --> 00:19:41.010
Help! Sir! Help!

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:43.420
He attacked me!

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.000
Look at him,

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.330
he's so turned on... he's got a nosebleed!

00:19:47.640 --> 00:19:48.790
It's terrifying!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:50.850
Look, his nose is bleeding.

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:52.210
Sir!

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:55.140
I'm so scared.

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.930
Save me, Sir!

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:58.500
He was trying to sexually assault me!

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:00.380
When I refused, he hit me!

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.000
Why are you doing this to me?

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:12.130
Hello?

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.390
Okay, are his injuries any better?

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:15.480
Okay.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.130
And has he calmed down now?

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:20.630
Okay.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:23.180
That's not good.

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.460
Don't let him make a scene outside.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.030
Okay? Please.

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:28.880
Alright, you calm him down first.

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:29.580
I'll be right there.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.080
Okay, thanks. Bye.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:37.470
Alright.

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:41.110
Now he wants a medical exam
to sue you. What do we do?

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:43.670
Chief, you have to believe me.

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:45.890
-I really...
-How can I believe you?

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:47.280
You want me to believe

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:48.770
someone would bang their own head

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:49.830
against a wall?

00:20:49.860 --> 00:20:50.610
Is that it?

00:20:50.630 --> 00:20:53.210
But he really did smash his head
into the wall himself!

00:20:53.210 --> 00:20:55.840
-Chief, I believe Zhongwen.
-I know,

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:56.780
Senior.

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:59.250
It's not that I don't trust our own guy.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.310
Right now, he's accusing him,

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:01.410
and he's accusing him back.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:02.430
It's not that I don't trust him,

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:05.760
but I can't wrongfully accuse
Assistant Chen either, can I?

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:08.050
I'm going to the Health Division.

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:09.620
Just tell them exactly what you saw.

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.120
-Chief.
-What now?

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:12.330
Inmate 7765 was accompanying

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.460
Inmate 7234

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:14.790
to the Health Division.

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.600
He says he saw something.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:18.000
Great! And?

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.650
What did you see? Tell us!

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:24.460
You saw it, didn't you? Speak up!

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:27.790
Well...

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:32.250
Assistant Chen was dizzy

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:34.860
and disoriented,

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:37.440
so he wandered towards the workshop.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:40.500
Then this CO followed him in

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:41.870
and told me to leave.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.760
That's when I saw this CO

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:45.850
grab Assistant Chen's head
and slam it against the wall!

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:46.880
Director, he's lying!

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:48.310
I never grabbed his head!

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:49.650
Wait. Okay, let him finish.

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:51.170
They must have coordinated their stories!

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:51.640
Continue.

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.540
After I saw that, I got so scared

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:54.890
I just ran off.

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:55.850
I don't know anything about

00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.310
what happened after that.

00:21:57.620 --> 00:21:59.120
I didn't want any trouble.

00:21:59.140 --> 00:22:00.140
Zhuang Xianzong,

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:00.990
I'm warning you.

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:03.180
Lying through your teeth
can get people killed!

00:22:03.180 --> 00:22:05.060
I'm telling the truth.

00:22:05.710 --> 00:22:07.040
Are you sure about this?

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:07.830
Yes.

00:22:07.850 --> 00:22:09.180
Alright. I understand.

00:22:10.990 --> 00:22:12.390
Senior, can I have a word?

00:22:16.220 --> 00:22:17.470
Is what you said true?

00:22:18.330 --> 00:22:19.330
It's true.

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:20.960
Senior, what should we do?

00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:22.200
Discipline him or force a resignation?

00:22:22.200 --> 00:22:23.200
What's your call?

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:24.420
But Chief,

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:26.210
you can't believe his pack of lies!

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:28.670
I know.
Alright, let's leave it here for now.

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:31.220
I need to go calm Assistant Chen first,

00:22:31.220 --> 00:22:31.970
okay?

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:34.760
This must not leak outside
under any circumstances.

00:22:34.760 --> 00:22:36.690
Go and make that clear to everyone.

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:41.560
You're not buying his story, are you?

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:42.630
Zhuang Xianzong.

00:22:43.240 --> 00:22:45.040
Did Chen Yihua put you up to this?

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:47.250
Director, no—

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:49.700
it's true!

00:22:49.960 --> 00:22:51.080
True?

00:22:51.880 --> 00:22:52.960
Are you happy now,

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:54.380
after screwing over a CO like this?

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:55.540
If I find out you lied,

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:56.380
you're dead.

00:22:56.940 --> 00:22:57.940
Take him back.

00:22:58.580 --> 00:22:59.330
Move!

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:03.720
You'd better think carefully!

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:08.080
Is what they said true?

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:21.110
I heard it's already settled.

00:23:21.330 --> 00:23:22.670
Inmate 7234 agreed not to escalate this,

00:23:22.670 --> 00:23:25.580
but on one condition:
he must be transferred to the open prison.

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:28.670
And Zhongwen... has to be reassigned.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:33.640
It means they're accepting
Inmate 7234's version of events.

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:35.380
Let's escalate this up the chain

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:36.750
and convene a gender equality meeting
to investigate thoroughly.

00:23:36.750 --> 00:23:38.420
Escalate it? He's connected and powerful,

00:23:38.420 --> 00:23:40.380
and he even has
Inmate 7765 giving false testimony.

00:23:40.380 --> 00:23:41.420
Sending Zhongwen away now would

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:43.500
probably just lead
to the same outcome, wouldn't it?

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:45.300
The key is that we need evidence.

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:46.750
Without it, all our talk is meaningless.

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:47.810
But how are we supposed to investigate?

00:23:47.810 --> 00:23:49.270
There are so many cameras.

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:52.280
We'll track Inmate 7234's movements.

00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:55.420
I refuse to believe
we can't find something.

00:23:57.100 --> 00:23:58.420
I'll go pull the surveillance footage.

00:23:58.420 --> 00:23:59.820
You should get some rest.

00:24:08.850 --> 00:24:09.450
Zhongwen.

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:10.850
I bought you braised trotters with noodles

00:24:10.850 --> 00:24:12.580
to help you settle your nerves.

00:24:13.070 --> 00:24:14.940
Why are you packing your stuff?

00:24:15.280 --> 00:24:17.170
It's just a few days of suspended duty.

00:24:17.170 --> 00:24:18.300
It's no use.

00:24:18.320 --> 00:24:20.170
I'm definitely getting fired over this.

00:24:20.170 --> 00:24:21.290
Nonsense!

00:24:21.320 --> 00:24:22.920
We're all on your side, okay?

00:24:30.180 --> 00:24:31.980
Does anyone want this mattress?

00:24:32.260 --> 00:24:33.750
I'll sell it for 3k.

00:24:33.850 --> 00:24:36.450
You drooled all over it.
I'll give you 2k for it.

00:24:38.660 --> 00:24:39.860
Let me think about it.

00:24:46.810 --> 00:24:47.400
Look,

00:24:47.790 --> 00:24:48.990
how cute is Ningning?

00:24:49.310 --> 00:24:50.830
What are you going to tell her today?

00:24:50.830 --> 00:24:52.080
"Daddy got fired"?

00:24:52.160 --> 00:24:53.560
It would break her heart.

00:24:54.090 --> 00:24:56.260
How about this:
leave Ningning with us for now.

00:24:56.260 --> 00:24:57.360
Just treat this suspension

00:24:57.360 --> 00:24:58.460
as a vacation.

00:24:58.610 --> 00:25:00.180
Rest up, spend some time
with your daughter.

00:25:00.180 --> 00:25:00.750
Okay?

00:25:04.840 --> 00:25:06.360
If you really leave like this,

00:25:06.360 --> 00:25:08.690
it means you admit
that you have done this.

00:25:09.020 --> 00:25:10.020
Right!

00:25:10.540 --> 00:25:11.920
And if you just bail,

00:25:11.920 --> 00:25:13.780
it'll mess up our whole schedule!

00:25:14.920 --> 00:25:16.980
You idiot—I'm wearing flip-flops!

00:25:21.590 --> 00:25:23.090
Will we really find a way?

00:25:25.540 --> 00:25:26.870
If there's truly no way,

00:25:27.170 --> 00:25:29.300
then this guy here will still find one.

00:25:29.920 --> 00:25:31.750
We will, we'll find a way.

00:25:33.170 --> 00:25:35.100
Everything's going to be alright.

00:25:46.290 --> 00:25:47.790
Stop worrying and come on!

00:25:47.920 --> 00:25:49.290
Enjoy the braised trotters with noodles.

00:25:49.290 --> 00:25:51.040
It wasn't easy to get this.

00:25:51.610 --> 00:25:52.980
I walked really far—

00:25:53.950 --> 00:25:56.380
the food from this place
is amazing, you know?

00:25:56.380 --> 00:25:57.130
Thank you.

00:25:57.420 --> 00:25:58.540
Want me to heat them up for you?

00:25:58.540 --> 00:25:59.540
No, it's fine.

00:26:38.050 --> 00:26:39.050
How are you doing?

00:27:17.170 --> 00:27:18.790
Come, Wa. Let me help you.

00:27:22.540 --> 00:27:24.540
I need to ask you a favor.

00:27:25.040 --> 00:27:26.670
Could you look into

00:27:26.670 --> 00:27:27.500
why Inmate 7765

00:27:27.500 --> 00:27:28.830
is committing perjury?

00:27:29.040 --> 00:27:30.770
Does he have leverage over him?

00:27:31.920 --> 00:27:33.420
What could anyone have over him?

00:27:33.420 --> 00:27:34.790
He's dirt poor.

00:27:34.890 --> 00:27:35.690
He'll do anything

00:27:35.690 --> 00:27:37.020
for anyone who pays him.

00:27:37.290 --> 00:27:38.420
Just for money?

00:27:38.760 --> 00:27:40.020
I don't have a lighter.

00:27:41.420 --> 00:27:42.020
I do.

00:27:46.540 --> 00:27:48.670
My buddy's being accused
of sexual assault.

00:27:48.670 --> 00:27:50.400
There's no conscience in this!

00:27:51.000 --> 00:27:52.630
Who has it easy in here?

00:27:53.130 --> 00:27:55.030
What's conscience good for?

00:27:55.550 --> 00:27:57.810
Buying instant noodles or toilet paper?

00:28:00.970 --> 00:28:03.630
Then I'm really begging you
this time, Wa. Please.

00:28:03.630 --> 00:28:05.380
Please, I'm begging you!

00:28:05.520 --> 00:28:06.640
I've told you:

00:28:06.660 --> 00:28:07.360
he doesn't cause me trouble,

00:28:07.360 --> 00:28:08.500
and I won't cause him any.

00:28:08.500 --> 00:28:09.510
This isn't about causing him trouble.

00:28:09.510 --> 00:28:10.500
It's about getting him to tell the truth.

00:28:10.500 --> 00:28:11.880
My buddy is getting destroyed
by him right now,

00:28:11.880 --> 00:28:13.280
and we're out of options!

00:28:13.630 --> 00:28:14.310
S-Squat down!

00:28:14.310 --> 00:28:14.770
Yes.

00:28:19.830 --> 00:28:21.330
It's okay. Get up.

00:28:23.150 --> 00:28:24.150
Sorry about that.

00:28:25.630 --> 00:28:27.250
I was too worked up just now.

00:28:28.250 --> 00:28:29.820
Well...

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:32.530
Here, have this pack
of cigarettes, alright?

00:28:32.550 --> 00:28:35.000
And if you want the cat,
I'll find a way to make it happen.

00:28:35.000 --> 00:28:36.130
You're giving me a cat now?

00:28:36.130 --> 00:28:37.860
So it can eat my fish, is that it?

00:28:37.940 --> 00:28:39.250
My fish is doing just fine!

00:28:39.250 --> 00:28:40.420
I just think it looks lonely now.

00:28:40.420 --> 00:28:41.750
Can you get another one in here for me?

00:28:41.750 --> 00:28:42.960
Are you stupid?

00:28:44.690 --> 00:28:47.690
Alright, I'll figure out a way
to get you another one.

00:28:48.380 --> 00:28:50.000
We actually caught Inmate 7765

00:28:50.000 --> 00:28:51.140
outside that day.

00:28:51.380 --> 00:28:53.130
He was totally acting as a lookout.

00:28:53.130 --> 00:28:54.300
Who was he keeping watch for?

00:28:54.300 --> 00:28:55.630
Inmate 7234, of course.

00:28:56.570 --> 00:28:58.900
My buddy was really
getting ruined by him.

00:29:00.130 --> 00:29:01.930
Please, Wa, will you help us out?

00:29:07.630 --> 00:29:08.920
Check in with Zhuang.

00:29:09.100 --> 00:29:09.720
Yes.

00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:15.280
As for Assistant Chen...

00:29:15.750 --> 00:29:17.630
Well, that's a matter for you officials.

00:29:17.630 --> 00:29:18.530
As for me...

00:29:21.210 --> 00:29:22.210
You get it, right?

00:29:26.240 --> 00:29:28.290
[Warden's Office]

00:29:50.530 --> 00:29:51.470
Sorry, Warden—

00:29:51.500 --> 00:29:52.630
I mean, greetings, Warden!

00:29:52.630 --> 00:29:54.760
What are you sneaking around here for?

00:29:57.050 --> 00:29:57.990
Sir, I have a matter

00:29:57.990 --> 00:30:00.320
I'd like to request your assistance with.

00:30:01.750 --> 00:30:03.380
Gao Zhizhuo?

00:30:05.250 --> 00:30:06.250
It's Gao Zhiyao.

00:30:08.410 --> 00:30:09.660
Oh, it's you.

00:30:11.810 --> 00:30:12.510
Get inside.

00:30:54.630 --> 00:30:55.380
Gao Zhiyao,

00:30:56.750 --> 00:30:57.680
heading to work?

00:30:58.380 --> 00:30:59.130
Senior,

00:31:00.750 --> 00:31:01.750
still here at this hour?

00:31:01.750 --> 00:31:04.550
Yeah. What did you get?
Is that a late-night snack?

00:31:05.880 --> 00:31:07.340
Yeah, a late-night snack.

00:31:08.500 --> 00:31:09.120
What kind?

00:31:12.130 --> 00:31:13.250
Fish ball soup.

00:31:15.250 --> 00:31:17.910
There's fish ball soup around here?
Since when?

00:31:18.750 --> 00:31:19.630
This...

00:31:20.250 --> 00:31:20.870
Uh...

00:31:21.970 --> 00:31:23.850
This...

00:31:23.880 --> 00:31:25.470
After I finished

00:31:25.490 --> 00:31:27.130
the fish ball soup,

00:31:27.130 --> 00:31:29.330
I passed by an aquarium and bought this.

00:31:29.690 --> 00:31:30.320
Yeah.

00:31:30.390 --> 00:31:31.550
Well, last time in your office,

00:31:31.550 --> 00:31:32.850
I saw you keep shrimp.

00:31:32.900 --> 00:31:35.030
So I bought a goldfish.

00:31:38.520 --> 00:31:40.450
Didn't you just say fish ball soup?

00:31:41.250 --> 00:31:43.500
The soup was the snack. Right.

00:31:45.350 --> 00:31:46.550
The goldfish is cute.

00:31:46.630 --> 00:31:48.360
They eat a lot and poop a lot too.

00:31:48.670 --> 00:31:49.940
When you change the water,

00:31:49.940 --> 00:31:51.690
remember to pay attention
to the temperature.

00:31:51.690 --> 00:31:53.220
Thanks for the tip, Senior.

00:31:53.500 --> 00:31:55.430
The shop owner has told me about it.

00:31:56.920 --> 00:31:59.320
Well... if that's all,
I'll head to my post.

00:32:20.590 --> 00:32:23.510
Ahua, take good care of Arhui, okay?

00:33:10.650 --> 00:33:12.250
Sir, I want a taste of it, too.

00:33:16.380 --> 00:33:17.980
Senior, please let me go out.

00:33:40.080 --> 00:33:41.980
There's a physical altercation
at Dorm R1.

00:33:41.980 --> 00:33:43.770
We request backup.

00:33:45.180 --> 00:33:48.560
Shui received. En route.

00:33:49.120 --> 00:33:50.160
This is Zhiyao.

00:33:50.190 --> 00:33:51.990
I'm also heading over to assist.

00:33:54.000 --> 00:33:56.130
If it was you calling for backup today,

00:33:56.420 --> 00:33:58.950
and everyone else just half-assed it
and left you hanging,

00:33:58.950 --> 00:34:00.010
how would you feel?

00:34:01.330 --> 00:34:02.700
I know you're innocent.

00:34:04.200 --> 00:34:06.860
But if this is the attitude
you're going to have,

00:34:07.500 --> 00:34:08.980
even though I'm on your side,

00:34:08.980 --> 00:34:11.380
I'd still have to ask
for your resignation.

00:34:14.500 --> 00:34:15.710
Because this is the only way I,

00:34:15.710 --> 00:34:17.570
as the Director, can protect you.

00:34:31.130 --> 00:34:31.760
Director,

00:34:33.250 --> 00:34:34.530
then what should I do?

00:34:36.389 --> 00:34:38.270
I really need this job.

00:34:39.250 --> 00:34:40.630
If you truly want to keep working here,

00:34:40.630 --> 00:34:42.030
then hold your head high.

00:34:47.500 --> 00:34:48.630
Up, I said!

00:34:56.389 --> 00:34:57.139
Zhongwen,

00:34:58.630 --> 00:35:00.520
only you can solve this yourself.

00:35:01.250 --> 00:35:02.780
